# The key every request to your Worker has to carry.
#
# A one-click deploy asks for this by name, and Wrangler reads it when you run
# the Worker locally. Without a key the Worker refuses every request, on
# purpose: the address is live and public from the moment it deploys, and an
# open search proxy is found within hours.
#
# Make one at https://momzv2022-ctrl.github.io/public-tracker-search/ — the
# page mints it in your browser and never sends it anywhere — or invent one of
# at least 16 characters. Your Worker shows it back to you on its front page
# once it is running, so there is nothing to write down.
#
# This line stays empty in the repository. A key committed here would not be a
# default; it would be everybody's key.
UTSI_API_KEY=
